OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sun 6 Sep to Tue 15 SepFAn
OL,6,Funsettled period is likely, with many
OL,7,Fplaces seeing showers or longer spells
OL,8,Fof rain at times. Rain will likely be
OL,9,Fmost frequent across northern and
OL,10,Fwestern areas, while the south and
OL,11,Feast are more likely to see some drier
OL,12,Finterludes. There is also the
OL,13,Fpotential for some strong and gusty
OL,14,Fwinds, particularly in the northwest.
OL,15,FTemperatures are likely to be near
OL,16,Faverage, although brief warm or very
OL,17,Fwarm spells are possible, especially
OL,18,Fin the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
