OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1788272318
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wed 16 Sep to Wed 30 Sep
OL,6,FConfidence is very low from mid-
OL,7,FSeptember onwards. A changeable
OL,8,Fpattern, with the wettest conditions
OL,9,Fin the northwest, will likely
OL,10,Ftransition towards more in the way of
OL,11,Fsettled or dry spells between weather
OL,12,Fsystems. The distribution of rainfall
OL,13,Fis uncertain at this range, but drier
OL,14,Fconditions than earlier in the month
OL,15,Fare likely for most. Temperatures are
OL,16,Flikely to be around average overall,
OL,17,Falthough some warm spells are
OL,18,Fpossible, particularly in the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
